{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-1","title":"2 Chronicles 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Asa, with Judah and many of Israel, moved by the prophecy of Azariah the son of Oded, make a solemn covenant with God. 16 He puts down Maachah his mother for her idolatry. 18 He brings dedicated things into the house of God, and enjoys a long peace.</p>\n<p>the Spirit. 20:14; 24:20; Nu 24:2; Jud 3:10; 2Sa 23:2; 2Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-2","title":"2 Chronicles 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>to meet Asa. Heb. before Asa. Hear ye me. 13:4; 20:15,20; Jud 9:7; Ps 49:1,2; Isa 7:13; Mt 13:9; Re 2:7,11,17 Re 2:29; 3:6,13,22 The Lord. 13:12; 32:8; De 20:1; Jas 4:8 if ye seek him. 4,15; 33:12; Isa 55:6,7; Jer 29:12-14; Mt 7:7,8 if ye forsake. 12:1-3; 24:20; 2Ki 21:14; 1Ch 28:9; Ro 11:1,2; Heb 10:38; 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-3","title":"2 Chronicles 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a long. 1Ki 12:28-33; Ho 3:4 true God. Jer 10:10; Joh 17:3; 1Th 1:9; 1Jo 5:20 a teaching. 17:8,9; Le 10:11; De 33:10; Ne 8:9; Eze 44:21-23; Mic 3:11; Mal 2:7 Mt 2:4,5; 1Ti 3:2 without law. Ro 2:12; 7:8,9; 1Co 9:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-4","title":"2 Chronicles 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>in their trouble. De 4:29,30; Jud 3:9,10; 10:10-16; Ps 106:44; Ho 6:1; 14:1-3 found of them. 15; Isa 55:6; 65:1,2; Ro 10:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-5","title":"2 Chronicles 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>no peace. Jud 5:6; 1Sa 13:6; Ps 121:8 great vexations. Mt 24:6,7; Lu 21:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-6","title":"2 Chronicles 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>nation. 12:15; 13:17; Mr 13:8; Lu 21:9,10 destroyed. Heb. beaten in pieces. God. 33:11; 36:17; Jud 2:14; Ps 106:41; Isa 10:6; Am 3:6; Lu 21:22-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-7","title":"2 Chronicles 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>ye strong. Jos 1:7,9; 1Ch 28:20; Ps 27:14; Isa 35:3,4; Da 10:19; 1Co 16:13 Eph 6:10 your work. Ge 15:1; Ru 2:12; Ps 19:11; 58:11; Mt 5:12,46; 6:1,4,6,18; 10:41,42 Lu 6:35; Ro 4:4,5; 1Co 3:8,14; 9:17,18; 15:58; Col 3:24; Heb 6:10 Heb 10:35; 2Jo 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-8","title":"2 Chronicles 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Oded. 1 took courage. 19:11; Isa 44:14; *margins Ac 28:15 abominable idols. Heb. abominations. Le 18:30; De 27:15; 1Ki 11:5,7; 2Ki 23:13; Isa 65:4; Jer 16:18 Eze 8:10; 1Pe 4:3; Re 17:4,5 the cities. 13:19 the altar of the Lord. 4:1; 8:12; 29:18; 2Ki 16:14; 18:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-9","title":"2 Chronicles 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the strangers. 11:16; 30:1-11,25 they fell. 1Ki 12:19; 1Ch 12:19 they saw. Ge 39:3; 1Sa 18:28; 1Ki 3:28; Zec 8:21-23; Ac 7:9,10; 9:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-10","title":"2 Chronicles 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the third month. Es 8:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-11","title":"2 Chronicles 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>offered. 14:13-15; Nu 31:28,29,50; 1Sa 15:15,21; 1Ch 26:26,27 the same time. Heb. in that day. seven hundred. 1:6; 7:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-12","title":"2 Chronicles 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>they entered. 23:16; 29:10; 34:31,32; De 29:1,12; 2Ki 23:3; Ne 9:38; 10:29 Jer 50:5; 2Co 8:5 seek. 4; De 4:29; 10:12; 1Ki 8:48; Jer 29:12,13; Ac 24:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-13","title":"2 Chronicles 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>whosoever. Ex 22:20; De 13:5-15; 17:2-5; 1Ki 18:40 whether small. Ge 19:11; Ex 12:29; De 29:18; Job 3:19; 34:19; Ps 115:13; Ac 26:22 Re 6:15; 20:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-14","title":"2 Chronicles 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>sware. Ne 5:13; 10:29 trumpets. Ps 81:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-15","title":"2 Chronicles 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>rejoiced. 23:16-21; 29:10,36; De 26:11; Ne 8:9; Ps 32:11; 119:111; Pr 3:17 2Co 1:12 sworn. Ps 119:106 sought him. 2,4,12; Isa 26:8; 45:19; Php 1:23 and he was. 4 the Lord. 6; Jos 23:1; Job 34:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-16","title":"2 Chronicles 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Maachah. 1Ki 15:13-24 the mother. that is, grandmother. 1Ki 15:2,10 he removed. 14:3-5; Ex 32:27,28; De 13:6-8; 33:9; Zec 13:3; Mr 3:21,31-35 2Co 5:16 idol. Heb. horror. cut down. 14:3-5; 34:7; Ex 32:20; Le 26:30; De 7:5,25,26; 9:21; 1Ki 15:14-24 2Ki 23:6,12,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-17","title":"2 Chronicles 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the high places. 14:3-5; De 12:13,14; 1Ki 3:2-4; 22:43; 2Ki 12:3; 14:4 the heart of Asa. 16:7-12; 1Ki 11:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-18","title":"2 Chronicles 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>brought. 1Ki 7:51; 15:14,15; 1Ch 26:20-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-15-19","title":"2 Chronicles 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>A.M. 3063-3073. B.C. 941-931. five and thirtieth. 16:1; 1Ki 15:16,17,31,33</p>"}]}